WEBVTT

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:04.102
<v><b>Expert:</b></v> You know, to be honest, I think you’re being a bit hard on him.

00:00:04.413 --> 00:00:06.617
I mean, he’s only twenty-five.

00:00:07.074 --> 00:00:10.218
It’s good that he has a job, and everybody needs a holiday.

00:00:10.701 --> 00:00:15.956
My advice is that you should let him go to Mexico, but when he comes back,

00:00:16.185 --> 00:00:20.279
you should sit down with him and talk to him about starting to pay rent.

00:00:20.721 --> 00:00:24.816
That way he’ll understand that he needs to start planning for the future and

00:00:24.964 --> 00:00:27.270
to start thinking about renting a flat.

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:32.627
But I know from talking to other parents that there are a lot of young people

00:00:32.652 --> 00:00:38.407
still living at home in their twenties and thirties, and some of them don’t even have jobs.

00:00:38.445 --> 00:00:41.697
So in many ways, I think you’re lucky.

00:00:41.982 --> 00:00:45.200
<v><b>Annabel:</b></v> You see? That’s just what I think…